  "name": "intovec",
  "description": "A specialized Rust utility crate providing a trait-based interface for converting various sequence types into vectors with a focus on minimizing memory allocations. It implements zero-copy transitions for owned types like boxed slices and Strings while providing fallback copy-based conversions for borrowed slices, abstracting over ownership patterns for high-performance data handling.",
